this asks a service of `serve`, whose protocol has no proof yet (its certificate waits for a library gate), and no certificate covers it (`$no_deadlocks`): structured joins certify the join only when the tasks' own waits are certified; raw channel waits have no certificate, even inside `concurrent`; use nonblocking `try_send`/`try_receive`, or opt this scope out with `$no_deadlocks = false`
